# Normalise line endings.
#
# The repository arrived with a mix of CRLF and LF — files uploaded through a
# browser on Windows kept CRLF while the rest stayed LF. Mixed endings make git
# report whole files as changed when only one line moved, and make exact-match
# tooling fail unpredictably.
#
# Text files are stored in the repository with LF. Git still checks them out
# with the local convention, so editing on Windows stays normal.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are never converted.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
